# Chat 04: party-wide rebuff. ProbeBish (Bishop) and ProbeHero (Hero) hunt apart; a free-form
# "everyone come get buffed" (Jev -> "gather up for buffs") walks the party together and the Bishop
# rebuffs everyone in range. A party of three: the test needs more than one member to reach.
# Setup (not recorded): floor start point, Dark Sight up, no party, bots offline; film.sh forgets the
# learned phrase first so Jev reads it fresh.
warp 104040000 140
darksight {me}
party {me} 0
offline ProbeBish
offline ProbeHero
park
record FriendServer/BotStory Server/docs/agents/evidence/video/2026-09-26/raw/chat-04-party-rebuff.mp4
wait 1
say !spawnbot ProbeBish
online ProbeBish
say !spawnbot ProbeHero
online ProbeHero
party {me} 3
cut
caption 6 A party of three: a Bishop, a Hero and the camera character
park
wait 6
say see all those snails? go clear em out
expectlog (ACT \[grind\]|-> grind)
park
caption 6 They split up to hunt, out of range of each other's party buffs
apart ProbeBish 350 230 40
apart ProbeHero 350 230 40
wait 2
say everyone come get buffed
expectlog ACT \[gather up for buffs\]
park
caption 8 "everyone come get buffed" - the party walks over, and the Bishop recasts its party buffs once everyone is in range
freshbuff {me} 2311003 15
freshbuff ProbeHero 2311003 15
freshbuff ProbeBish 2311003 15
wait 4
say see all those snails? go clear em out
expectlog gather up for buffs\][^\n]*\n(.*\n)*.*(ACT \[grind\]|-> grind)
park
caption 5 ...then back to hunting
wait 7
stop
# Teardown (not recorded): one logout + yes signs off both bots, then dissolve the party.
signoff ProbeHero ProbeBish
say !leaveparty
party {me} 0
